{"data":[{"article":{"title":"GPUs are financed for years. AI workloads run for weeks."},"author_id":"1648404171090018307","created_at":"2026-10-16T21:03:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111201326407508153"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/article/2111…","end":277,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2111162320684507136","start":254,"status":404,"unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2111162320684507136","url":"https://t.co/4dLfWSb3Vn"}]},"id":"2111201326407508153","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":741,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"GPUs are financed for years. AI workloads run for weeks.\n\nOur Compute Market-Making White Paper explores that gap:\n\n1. Financing shapes the short-term premium.\n2. Not everyone can capture this premium. \n3. Hedging reduces tail risk, but comes at a cost. https://t.co/4dLfWSb3Vn","url":"https://x.com/hyperbolic_labs/status/2111201326407508153"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111214658573246464"]},"author_id":"1837960126239854592","created_at":"2026-10-16T21:56:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111214660217438610"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/yJH4ec2YEX","end":284,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/buildAgoat/status/2111214660217438610/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111214658573246464","start":261,"url":"https://t.co/yJH4ec2YEX"}]},"id":"2111214660217438610","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Cheng Lou released Handwired, a toy project that compiles regular JavaScript into a neural net. No training, exact outputs vs the JS program, fully differentiable, and it runs in the browser without a GPU.\n\nCode that becomes a network, without a training loop. https://t.co/yJH4ec2YEX","url":"https://x.com/buildAgoat/status/2111214660217438610"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111201032445231104"]},"author_id":"2104142839785373696","created_at":"2026-10